@ad1205 avoid using responsibility/ability words in your resume. Try grammarly for different variations. Responsibilities include establishing and managing product roadmap and third-party development relationship with clients.
To 
Established and managed product roadmap <some metrics like delivering x number of projects/KBR/OKR> <leading to something>

@ad1205  think more metrics for these too... some of these are can be used in behavior answers instead during interview. These are part of SDM/TPM responsibilities too "Resolved blocks for my teams in a large organization by developing relationships and establishing a community of mutual benefit and coordinate multiple teams working on the same product to synchronize development efforts and release.
Present and explain the feature and user stories to the development team throughout the development process in all forums associated with Agile process.
"

@ad1205  in case you lead the design/dev... Collaborated with a team of software developers in designing and developing enhancements to a large enterprise application developed in Asp.net C# and SQL Server.
TO
Lead the design and development of <x number of> enhancements for a large (what do you mean by large - any way to quantify this?) enterprise application developed in Asp.net, C# and SQL Server

